---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import PageIntro from '../components/PageIntro.astro';
import MediaGallery from '../components/MediaGallery.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
---
<Layout title="Music & Performance" dark description="Wharton Chan plays alto saxophone and clarinet with The Marmalade Jammers: danceable swing jazz for Lindy Hop socials, weddings, and events.">
  <div class="music-heading"><PageIntro eyebrow="02 / Alto saxophone · Clarinet · Swing" title="Jazz is a conversation." description="Between musicians. Between a band and a dance floor. Between a phrase and the person listening. There is always something to say, and something to hear."><a class="button" href="/book/">Book a Performance <span aria-hidden="true"><svg class="arrow" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 13L13 3M3 3H13V13" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2" /></svg></span></a></PageIntro></div>
  <div class="container">
    <section class="split-content"><h2>Finding the music<br />through movement.</h2><div><p>Wharton rediscovered his love of jazz through Lindy Hop in 2019. The dance brought swing music into focus: its rhythm, its improvisation, and its invitation to move together.</p><p>He returned to the alto saxophone and later expanded to clarinet. Today, he performs as a frontline musician with The Marmalade Jammers, bringing a dancer's ear to the bandstand.</p><p>For him, a performance is a shared conversation. Listening matters as much as playing.</p></div></section>
    <section class="split-content"><div><span class="eyebrow">The Marmalade Jammers</span><h2 style="margin-top:18px">Danceable<br />swing jazz.</h2></div><div><p>Swing made with dancers in mind: music for the pulse of a Lindy Hop social, the warmth of a wedding, or a gathering that needs a little lift.</p><div class="tags"><span class="tag">Swing dance socials</span><span class="tag">Weddings</span><span class="tag">Corporate events</span><span class="tag">Private functions</span><span class="tag">Live entertainment</span></div><p style="margin-top:25px">Wharton is a frontline musician with the group. Full-band arrangements are coordinated with the band leadership team.</p>{site.bandInstagram ? <a class="text-link" href={site.bandInstagram}>The band on Instagram <svg class="arrow" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 13L13 3M3 3H13V13" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2" /></svg></a> : <p style="font-size:.75rem">The band's verified Instagram link will be added here.</p>}</div></section>
    <section id="performances" class="section-tight"><div class="section-header"><div><span class="eyebrow">From the bandstand</span><h2>Listen. Move. Connect.</h2></div><p>Space for moments from live performance. Verified photographs and clips are coming; the illustrations below are placeholders.</p></div><MediaGallery /></section>
    <section class="split-content"><h2>Let's set the room<br />in motion.</h2><div><p>Book Wharton Chan or The Marmalade Jammers. Tell us about your event, the setting, and the atmosphere you have in mind. Enquiries are subject to availability and confirmation.</p><a class="button" href="/book/">Make a booking enquiry <span aria-hidden="true"><svg class="arrow" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 13L13 3M3 3H13V13" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2" /></svg></span></a></div></section>
  </div>
</Layout>
